<!-- FAQ Section -->
<section id="faq" style="padding:5rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom:3rem;">
      <span class="section-label">Common Questions</span>
      <div class="accent-line"></div>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem);font-weight:300;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;">Bangladesh Clothing Manufacturers — Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="max-width:800px;">
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What is the typical MOQ for clothing manufacturers in Bangladesh?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Most Bangladesh garment factories have MOQs ranging from 300 to 1,000 pieces per style. Premium manufacturers may require 1,000+ pieces, while smaller factories can sometimes accommodate 150–300 piece orders for startup brands. SDF Clothing's MOQ is 300 pieces per style with flexible size and colour split.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How do I verify Bangladesh clothing manufacturer certifications?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Request current certificate copies and verify them through the issuing organisation's database — GOTS at gots.org, OEKO-TEX at oeko-tex.com, BSCI through amfori.org, WRAP at wrapcompliance.org. Always request certificate numbers and check expiration dates. Never accept a certificate image without verifying the number is active.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What are the payment terms for Bangladesh garment factories?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Standard payment terms are 30% deposit to start production, 70% before shipment. Established factories may accept L/C (Letter of Credit) for large orders. Never pay 100% upfront to any factory.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How long does shipping from Bangladesh take?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Ocean freight to EU/UK takes 20–30 days, to USA 25–35 days, to Australia 30–40 days. Air freight reduces this to 5–7 days but costs significantly more. Production adds 30–45 days before shipping. Use our free <a href="/tools/production-timeline" style="color:#e00;text-decoration:none;">Production Timeline Calculator</a> to map your exact deadlines from launch date.</p>
