        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How do I write a professional inquiry email to a clothing manufacturer?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">A factory inquiry email should include your garment type, fabric, quantity, required timeline, destination country, preferred incoterms, and any certification requirements. Vague emails get ignored. Use our free <a href="/tools/manufacturer-email-generator" style="color:#e00;text-decoration:none;">Manufacturer Email Generator</a> to build a complete, structured inquiry in 30 seconds.</p>
